    "App 內沒有附 driver（開發版）。請在專案目錄執行 scripts/build-audio-driver.sh 後 sudo scripts/install-audio-driver.sh。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app does not include a driver (development build). In the project directory, run scripts/build-audio-driver.sh, then sudo scripts/install-audio-driver.sh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 內附的驅動比已安裝的新；更新會重啟音訊服務。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The driver bundled with the app is newer than the installed one; updating restarts audio services."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 層的 EQ 與 AU 效果鏈——只套這個 App，與裝置層是不同責任的兩次" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App-level EQ and AU effect chain - applied only to this app, separate from device-level processing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 音訊處理" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App Audio Processing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple 原生" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Native Apple"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chorus" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chorus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chorus 完全不碰這個 App 的音訊——per-app 調整與裝置等化／軟體音量都略過它" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chorus does not touch this app's audio - it skips per-app adjustments, device EQ, and software volume"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chorus 完全不碰這個 App：不建 per-app tap，裝置等化與軟體音量也略過它（調整保留，適合 DAW、遊戲、視訊會議）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chorus does not touch this app: it creates no per-app tap, and device EQ and software volume also skip it (adjustments are retained; suited to DAWs, games, and video calls)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DDC" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DDC"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DDC 硬體鏡射（不損音質）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DDC hardware mirroring (no audio quality loss)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DDC 診斷" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DDC Diagnostics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "DP/HDMI 螢幕音訊沒有系統音量，macOS 會停用 Touch Bar／控制中心／音量鍵。安裝虛擬輸出裝置後，把它設為預設輸出：系統音量 UI 全部恢復，音訊轉送到螢幕；支援 DDC 的螢幕直接鏡射硬體音量（不損音質），其餘用數位衰減。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DP/HDMI display audio has no system volume, so macOS disables the Touch Bar, Control Center, and volume keys. After installing a virtual output device, set it as the default output: all system volume UI is restored and audio is forwarded to the display. Displays that support DDC mirror hardware volume directly (no audio quality loss); others use digital attenuation."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IOAVService：已配對" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IOAVService: paired"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "IOAVService：無（DDC 不可用或已降級）" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "IOAVService: none (DDC unavailable or downgraded)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
