    "—" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "—"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ⓘ 若拖曳滑桿後畫面雪花／訊號異常：部分螢幕的 scaler 承受不了連續 I2C 寫入（已內建節流）。復發時開啟「強制軟體調光」並保留此診斷輸出回報。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ⓘ If the display shows static or an abnormal signal after dragging the slider: some display scalers cannot handle continuous I2C writes (throttling is built in). If it recurs, enable \"Force Software Dimming\" and keep this diagnostic output for your report."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "▲ 亮度可用但音量 0x62 不通：此螢幕不支援 DDC 音量。可在選單列該音訊裝置上按右鍵標記「不支援 DDC 音量」，滑桿會誠實停用。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "▲ Brightness is available, but volume 0x62 is unavailable: this display does not support DDC volume. Right-click this audio device in the menu bar and mark \"DDC volume unsupported\" so the slider is honestly disabled."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "▲ 讀取全滅但服務存在：寫入很可能是「假成功」（轉換晶片本地 ACK、不透傳）。改用 DP／USB-C 直連，或螢幕若有第二輸入埠可換埠。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "▲ All reads fail but the service is present: writes are likely \"false successes\" (the converter chip ACKs locally and does not pass through). Use a direct DP/USB-C connection, or switch ports if the display has a second input."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "、" : {
      "comment" : "列舉分隔符（AX 描述、離線裝置名單）",
